-- Photos for the CookMatch seed recipes, from Wikimedia Commons (freely licensed: CC or public domain).
-- Each recipe's attribution line credits the photographer and licence, as the licences require.
-- Every seed recipe gets a photo; a few close variants share one. Safe to run more than once.
-- Load it with the Supabase SQL editor after seed.sql and/or the files in supabase/seeds/.
